  "description": "Universal pure C# .NET 10 Multimodal LLM, Generative Image & Video, Vision & Voice inference engine supporting Meta Llama 3, DeepSeek V2/V3/R1 (MLA + MoE), Microsoft Phi-3/Phi-4, Google Gemma 2/4, Mistral, Alibaba Qwen 2/2.5/Qwen2-VL, Flow-Matching DiT (Text-to-Image), Latent VAE Decoders, ViT/SigLIP Vision Preprocessing, 2D Spatial Multimodal Projectors, Video Frame Samplers, 3D-RoPE Spatio-Temporal Embeddings, Whisper STT, and Kokoro-82M TTS. Native AOT compatible, zero-copy GGUF memory-mapped files, AVX-512/AVX2 quantized SIMD kernels, bare-metal GPU acceleration, pure C# Log-Mel audio DSP, and full-duplex conversational voice. Zero Python, zero C++ runtime dependencies.",
